course: dictionary
lesson: 9187
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning, and the sentence tells you which one is meant. Social can be an adjective or a noun. «Social workers visit to make sure children are safe.» Here social is about people and how they live and get on together, so a social worker helps people in their community.
explain: Read the words around it to choose. «Too much time on screens and social media is linked with worse sleep and lower mood.» Screens and posts are the clues: social media means websites and apps for sharing posts. Always try your meaning in the sentence and check that it still makes sense.
explain: Social can also describe a person or an animal. A social person likes being with other people, talking and playing. Social animals, like bees and wolves, live in groups. Ask yourself: is this about groups of people, or about liking company?
fact: Social means about people and how they live, meet and get on together in groups.
fact: A social person likes to be with other people and to talk and play.
fact: Social animals, like bees and wolves, live in groups.
fact: Informally, a social is a party or get-together for a club or school.
fact: «Social studies» in the USA and Canada is about people, history, places and communities.
exercise: «Too much time on screens and social media is linked with worse sleep.» What does social media mean here? | Animals that live in groups | Lessons about people in history | A party for a club | *Websites and apps for sharing posts
exercise: Mia says a social animal lives alone in a cave. What is the right idea? | *A social animal lives in a group, like wolves | A social animal lives in a group, like bees | A social animal can only swim | A social animal is always asleep
exercise: «The class social is on Friday afternoon.» What does social mean in this sentence? | *A party or get-together | A kind of history lesson | A type of bee | A worker who checks children are safe
test: «Ella is a social person and loves talking to new friends.» What does social mean here? | Is about history and places | Lives in a group like bees | *Likes being with other people | Is a party for a club
test: In «social skills», like taking turns and sharing, what does social mean? | Being about animals that live in groups | Being a party for a school | Being about websites and apps | *Being about how people get on together
exam: «Many apps and social networks require users to be at least 13 years old.» Which meaning of social fits best here? | Animals that live in groups | *Websites and apps for sharing posts | A party for a club | Being quiet and shy
